  "description": "A Redis-backed implementation of PostQuantum.Jwt's IPqJwtReplayCache, intended for horizontally-scaled deployments of PostQuantum.AspNetCore. Uses StackExchange.Redis SET NX with TTL = remaining token lifetime, so single-use jti enforcement coordinates across all instances. Companion to PostQuantum.AspNetCore, released in lockstep with it. Production-quality for controlled issuer/verifier systems; the underlying construction is NOT independently audited (a permanent, documented limitation — see the repository's KNOWN-GAPS.md).",
